WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.370
(whimsical guitar music)

00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:02.450
- I'm the youngest

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:04.410
certified integrative nutrition

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:06.130
health coach in the country

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:07.260
and the world, as far as I know,

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:09.540
but I usually don't say that part.

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:11.670
Hi, my name is Haile Thomas.

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:15.100
I'm 17 years old, a vegan health activist,

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:19.440
the CEO of The HAPPY
Organization, and a total foodie.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.880
The healthy eating aspect
really came out of my dad,

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:25.180
who was diagnosed with type 2 diabetes

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:27.730
when I was about eight
and that's when we really

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:29.970
just started experimenting
with healthy foods

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:32.080
and decided to ditch the medication.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.010
And in a few years, we were actually able

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:36.320
to completely reverse his condition,

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:39.760
and so that, to me,
proved the power of food,

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:42.150
but also the potential in healthy foods,

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:43.850
and eventually becoming vegan.

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:47.584
The inspiration behind
the sweet potato pizza

00:00:47.584 --> 00:00:51.840
that I'm making today really
came from just being creative

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:53.220
and kind of playing around.

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:55.880
I absolutely love sweet potatoes.

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:58.900
They're one of my favorites
foods besides avocados,

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:03.230
and so I really wanted to find
a way to get that sweetness,

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:04.270
but that heartiness.

00:01:04.270 --> 00:01:05.620
Essentially just being able

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:07.900
to take a core group of ingredients

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:09.470
and kind of swap it out, and mix it up,

00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:12.480
and add different sauces,
and add different greens,

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:15.360
and proteins, and things like
that is really fun for me

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:18.590
and I enjoy kind of playing
with those combinations.

00:01:18.590 --> 00:01:21.340
That's kind of how this pizza was born.

00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:23.930
My advocacy really started
when I was about 10

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:26.960
and saw this evidence of
my dad just getting better

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:28.500
and our family learning so much

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:31.490
from not only one perspective
of food and exercise,

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:34.340
but also all the other
components of just life

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:36.160
that contribute to health and wellbeing.

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:38.440
That was really eye-opening for me

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:41.780
and definitely helped me
integrate those aspects

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:44.190
into our nonprofit programs

00:01:44.190 --> 00:01:47.710
and just in everyday life for me as well.

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:50.310
Oh, my gosh, I love Michelle Obama.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:54.710
She is amazing and I'm so incredibly lucky

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:57.130
to have met her six or seven times.

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:00.320
I'm just always so
constantly inspired by her

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:01.450
and everything that she does

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:02.610
and everything that she represents.

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:04.670
Her telling me to just keep on going

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:07.840
and continue to stay strong in everything

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:08.673
that I'm trying to share

00:02:08.673 --> 00:02:10.930
because the world really
does need to hear it

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:15.160
and that has fueled me literally
for the past six years,

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:19.720
so I am so proud to be a black girl

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:22.840
in Gen Z representing food and wellness.

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:27.090
It's so important for us to
embrace health and wellbeing

00:02:27.090 --> 00:02:29.610
in order for us to all fuel
our dreams and passions,

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:31.900
and so I'm grateful to be in this space

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:33.890
and grateful to share this message.

